# Polestar Experimental, Riverglades for the Horde, part 2 of 4 (2026-11-12). Hand-written from players'
# recordings of the zone and Forever's quest data for titles, levels, objectives and places.
# Order: Tran'gul's first errand in Sunnyglade (the Twilight cult's farm town) with Fuzzle's escort, and back;
# Na'zok's camp and the ogres of Bolder'ok in the hills to the north-east (levels 36-42), with Jom-jom's escort on
# the way back to the ogres' chieftain. Clubtoe's quests in Sunnyglade wait for part 4, on the way west.
# Offered only after another quest is handed in (players' recordings): Tran'gul's quests after Show Them How It's
# Done (part 1); Digging for Answers after Twilight Missives; Biting the Hand's escort after the finger bones;
# Clugfist's Decree and Bloodmaster's Ring after Might Makes Right; each bout of the Bloodmaster's Ring after the one
# before.
# The Bloodmaster's Ring bouts are one-on-one fights against elite ogres and beasts (41-45): an optional side chain
# for players who want it. Recorded players of levels 41-43 won them (one lost a bout and took it again).
# Elites, each behind a group choice: Scoutmaster Vargas (42), and Chogg'Zac (41) in part 4.
# Left out on purpose:
# - Step One: Rock (95183): Hamur offers it only once Might Makes Right is handed in, when the rock piles are back
#   in the hills behind you; Step Two: More Rock (96026) asks for ten Heavy Weightstones, a blacksmith's make.
# - Our Ogre Friend (94733), A Boar's Delight (94734) and A Treat for a Friend (94737): offered only after the fourth
#   bout of the Ring, and the sweetberries grow by the Eastsea pirates far to the south-east.

step Tran'gul
  tip Experimental route (alpha): if a step is wrong, tell us on Polestar's Discord or GitHub and name the step.
  tip Tran'gul stands beside Krom'rosh in the middle of Rog'mar: now that the Farholde camp has had its lesson, he has work in Sunnyglade.
  accept 94672                          -- Encroaching Twilight
  accept 94680                          -- Twilight Missives

step Fuzzle
  tip West of Rog'mar the Twilight cult holds the farm town of Sunnyglade. Fuzzle, a kobold who wants out, hides in the middle of the town.
  accept 94961                          -- Biting the Hand

step Sunnyglade
  tip The cultists fill the streets and fields; the Shadowmancers on the town's northern side carry the missives. The finger bones drop from all of them.
  kill 256952 x8 quest 94672.1          -- Twilight Raider
  kill 254560 x8 quest 94672.2          -- Twilight Shadowmancer
  kill 256798 x8 quest 94672.3          -- Twilight Neophyte
  collect 265745 x3 quest 94680.1       -- Twilight Missive
  collect 267073 x20 quest 94961.1      -- Twilight Finger Bone

step Fuzzle
  tip Fuzzle wants out of Sunnyglade: lead him west to his treasure at the edge of town and keep the cultists off him.
  turnin 94961
  accept 94963                          -- Biting the Hand
  complete 94963 @41.6,47.7             -- lead Fuzzle out of Sunnyglade to his treasure, west of the town
  turnin 94963                          -- Fuzzle's Treasure

step Tran'gul
  tip East back to Rog'mar.
  turnin 94672
  turnin 94680
  accept 94727                          -- Digging for Answers: for Clubtoe in Sunnyglade, in part 4

step WANTED: Scoutmaster Vargas
  when group 95882
  tip Scoutmaster Vargas is an elite (level 42) at the Alliance scouts' camp in the hills south-east of Na'zok, where you go next: grouping up is advised. The poster hangs in the middle of the fort; Neza Bloodsnout takes the eye, in part 4.
  accept 95882                          -- the Wanted poster

step Na'zok's camp
  tip North-east from Rog'mar up into the hills: Na'zok watches the Paletusk boars from his camp.
  accept 95163                          -- Drive Them Back
  accept 95162                          -- Paletusk Harvesting

step Bolder'ok
  tip North-west to Bolder'ok, the ogres' town. Clugfist, its chieftain, sits on the hill. The ogres are friendly while you leave them alone.
  accept 95424                          -- Clugfist: Might Makes Right
  accept 95425                          -- Unworthy Champion

step The Twilight ogres' camp
  tip The Twilight Maulers and Firecallers camp on the ridge east of Na'zok. Klunk, who carries the Skullbasher, stands among them. Just south of the ogres, Scoutmaster Vargas (an Alliance elite, level 42) and his Farholde Ambushers hold the scouts' camp: keep north of it unless you came with a group for him.
  kill 260968 x7 quest 95424.1          -- Twilight Mauler
  kill 261497 x7 quest 95424.2 @75.7,26.9  -- Twilight Firecaller
  collect 269257 quest 95425.1          -- Skullbasher, from Klunk

step Scoutmaster Vargas
  when group 95882
  collect 268581 quest 95882.1 @75.4,34.3  -- Scoutmaster's Eye

step The paletusks
  tip South down the hills, round the west side of the Alliance scouts' camp: tap the Young Paletusks with Na'zok's staff to send them home; the Mature Paletusks around the hills drop the boar meat.
  use 268521 quest 95163.1 @72.4,39.5   -- Swineherd's Staff, on the Young Paletusks
  collect 769 x10 quest 95162.1 @68.7,30.3  -- Chunk of Boar Meat, from the Mature Paletusks

step Na'zok
  turnin 95163
  turnin 95162

step Jom-jom's Escape
  tip Jom-jom waits by the Twilight ogres' camp north-east of Na'zok: take him home to Bolder'ok and keep the cultists off him. If he falls, take the quest from him again.
  accept 94556                          -- Jom-jom
  complete 94556 @64.4,15.6             -- help Jom-jom reach Bolder'ok

step Bolder'ok
  tip Back to Clugfist on his hill. Jezap Jinglesprocket runs the Bloodmaster's Ring just below it.
  turnin 94556                          -- Clugfist
  turnin 95424
  turnin 95425
  accept 95428                          -- Clugfist's Decree: for Krom'rosh in Rog'mar, in part 4
  accept 94668                          -- Bloodmaster's Ring
  turnin 94668                          -- Jezap Jinglesprocket
  accept 94669 optional                 -- Pay to Play: the Ring's bouts, one-on-one fights with elites (41-45); a deposit first

step The Bloodmaster's Ring: Buzzbeak
  when onquest 94669
  tip Each bout is a fight in the ring below Clugfist's hill against an elite: Buzzbeak (41), Kronk and Bonegnaw (42), Mog'thar (43), Snufflesnout (44) and Chub'chob (45). Come in rested, with full health and mana; if a bout goes wrong, Jezap offers it again.
  turnin 94669                          -- Jezap Jinglesprocket
  accept 94670 optional                 -- Bloodmaster's Ring: Buzzbeak
  complete 94670 @65.7,20.2             -- beat Buzzbeak
  turnin 94670

step The Bloodmaster's Ring: Kronk and Bonegnaw
  when turnedin 94670
  accept 94739 optional                 -- Kronk
  complete 94739 @65.7,20.2
  turnin 94739
  accept 94962 optional                 -- Bonegnaw
  complete 94962 @65.7,20.2
  turnin 94962

step The Bloodmaster's Ring: Mog'thar
  when turnedin 94962
  accept 94964 optional                 -- Mog'thar (43)
  complete 94964 @65.7,20.2
  turnin 94964

step The Bloodmaster's Ring: Snufflesnout and Chub'chob
  when turnedin 94964
  tip The last two are level 44 and 45: leave them for later if Mog'thar was a close fight.
  accept 94965 optional                 -- Snufflesnout (44)
  complete 94965 @65.7,20.2
  turnin 94965
  accept 95063 optional                 -- Chub'chob (45)
  complete 95063 @65.7,20.2
  turnin 95063                          -- Clugfist, on the hill
